:0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810577989","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100676#issuecomment-2810577989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100676","id":2810577989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nhgRF","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T19:39:17Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T19:39:17Z","body":"Seems to occur even with 1 shape if you wait a bit. I don't see any obvious problems in the GDScript that would lead to this behaviour. Inspecting the node while the scene is running shows the increases in linear velocity and angular velocity when the shape starts to move. The motion seems to be specifically directed around the top left corner of the shape. Changing the mass from `10000` to something small like `10` has no impact.\n\nSelecting both the RigidBody2D (smaller square) and the CollisionPolygon2D (larger square) under the Remote tab shows the following after the square has already tipped over to the left:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca985bab-89a8-4944-bd92-aa3c14cf3726)\n\nThe location of the smaller square that appears when selecting the RigidBody2D is suspicious, since it seems to be located at the point the square is rotating around. The larger square that appears when selecting the CollisionPolygon2D is also bigger than the visible shape that seems to form the collider based on interactions with the ground.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810577989/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810587006","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100676#issuecomment-2810587006","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100676","id":2810587006,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nhid-","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T19:43:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T19:43:48Z","body":"If `can_sleep` is not disabled by the script and the boxes are added slowly, the RigidBody2Ds go to sleep and the issue does not occur. If the boxes are added quickly though even without `can_sleep` being disabled the issue still occurs, though the RigidBody2Ds do eventually go to sleep after the strange falling over motion.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2810587006/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]